ldsymbol{B}\\boldsymbol{A}$ is correct?","options":["$\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{B}=\\boldsymbol{B}\\boldsymbol{A}$ for every such pair, as for products of numbers","$\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{B}\\ne\\boldsymbol{B}\\boldsymbol{A}$ for every such pair, as composition is not commutative","$\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{B}=\\boldsymbol{B}\\boldsymbol{A}$ holds exactly when $\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{B}$","$\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{B}=\\boldsymbol{B}\\boldsymbol{A}$ holds for some pairs and fails for others"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"dcf7772c016eda87d2dbb617","time_limit":40}]}}